config EGISFP
	bool "Egis EC617 TrustZone sensor hardware control (Rust)"
	depends on RUST && GPIOLIB && OF && EVENTFD
	help
	  Power, reset and interrupt notifications for an EC617 whose SPI bus
	  belongs to TrustZone. This is bring-up hardware control, not a
	  fingerprint matching or enrollment driver. A userspace libfprint
	  adapter and trusted-app protocol client are also required.

	  Built-in only: Linux 6.18's Rust miscdevice abstraction does not set
	  file_operations.owner to pin a loadable driver during open files.
	  No suspend wakeup support yet. Say N unless developing this driver.
